<title>SINGAPORE: Electronic Resources requests suspension.</title>
<headline>Electronic Resources requests suspension.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics components distributor Electronic Resources Ltd on Thursday requested a suspension in the trading of its shares with immediate effect pending an announcement.</p>
<p>It made the request in a letter released by the Stock Exchange of Singapore.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
